        <button
            type="submit"
            class="bg-primary hover:shadow-button inline-flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-full px-8 py-2.5 font-semibold text-white transition duration-300 sm:w-auto"
        >
            Subscribe
        </button>
    </form>-->
    </div>
</div>
